    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "25 Kilmore Close comes to the market with Delaney Estates, offering a well-appointed three-bedroom semi-detached family home which has been extended to the side and is located in a popular and mature residential area of Artane, Dublin 5. This spacious property presents an excellent opportunity for new owners to modernise and upgrade it according to their own personal taste and style and the long rear garden offers the new owner the opportunity to further extend the property if desired subject to planning permission. The home provides a wonderful blank canvas for those wishing to create a personalised family residence in a highly regarded location!\n\nThe accommodation includes a storm porch, dining room with solid fuel open fireplace, living room with solid fuel open fireplace and a kitchen/breakfast room with floor to eye level units, integrated electric hob and oven and is plumbed with under counter fridge and washing machine. An extended side ground floor guest w.c. with toilet and wash hand basin which is plumbed for a shower (not installed) and also plumbed for a dryer completes the accommodation on the ground floor. \nUpstairs there are three spacious bedrooms, bathroom with bath and electric shower overhead and wash hand basin and a separate w.c. with toilet. A roomy landing offers stira attic access and a hot press. \n\nThe beautiful long and sunny rear garden means one can al fresco dine in Spring and Summer further enhances the appeal of this wonderful home.\nTo the front of the property there is a private driveway providing off-street parking. \n\nThe location is truly superb with Beaumont Hospital, Artane Shopping Centre, Northside Shopping Centre, supermarkets, schools, cafés, restaurants and a wide range of local services all within easy reach. Public transport is excellent, with several bus routes nearby and Killester DART Station within convenient access. For commuters, the M50 and M1 are only minutes away, providing quick routes to Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre.\n\nTo avoid disappointment, early viewing is highly recommended!\n\nAccommodation\n\nGround Floor\n\nStorm porch\nTiled floor & sliding patio door\n\nHallway\nLaminate timber floor\n\nDining room\nLaminate timber floor. Solid fuel open fireplace\n\nLiving room\nLaminate timber floor. Solid fuel open fireplace\n\nKitchen / breakfast room\nTiled floor. Floor to eye level units, integrated electric hob and oven, plumbed for under counter fridge/ freezer & washing machine. Breakfast bar\n\nExtended guest w.c.\nTiled floor. Toilet & wash hand basin. Plumbed for shower but not installed. Plumbed for dryer\n\n\nFirst Floor\n\nLanding\nCarpet. Stira attic access. Hot-press with factory insulator water tank\n\nBathroom\nBath & overhead electric shower. Wash hand basin\n\nSeparate w.c.\nToilet\n\nBedroom 1\nCarpet. Build in sliderobes\n\nBedroom 2\nCarpet. Build in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3\nCarpet. Built in storage\n\nOutside\n\nFront:\nPrivate driveway providing off-street parking and a garden laid in lawn. \n\nRear:\nLong north facing rear garden laid in lawn and enclosed on all sides. \n\n\n"
      },
      {
