      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Bright & spacious throughout </li><li> Side extension with ground floor guest w.c. (plumbing in place for a shower) </li><li> Gas fired central heating </li><li> Double glazed UPVC windows </li><li> Long sunny rear garden offering the potential to extend the existing property if desired </li><li> Attic is floored for storage and was insulated in 2015 </li><li> Private driveway to the front </li><li> Numerous bus routes along Oscar Traynor Road</li></ul>"
